# Cloudflare Pages _headers - Rep Today marketing site.
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/headers/
#
# No HSTS header is set by hand: reptoday.app is a `.app` domain, which is on
# the HSTS preload list, and Cloudflare Pages serves every request over HTTPS
# with an auto-provisioned certificate. Adding Strict-Transport-Security here
# would be redundant (and easy to misconfigure). See DEPLOY.md.
#
# No Content-Security-Policy is set. The waitlist form posts to Kit's public sign-up
# endpoint (app.kit.com) and may show Kit's reCAPTCHA check in an iframe from the same
# origin, and the web events post to the Convex site, so a CSP would need connect-src and
# frame-src for those origins; authoring and verifying one is a follow-up in DEPLOY.md
# rather than shipped blind.

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=(), payment=(), usb=(), interest-cohort=()

# Long-lived immutable cache for the fingerprint-free static screenshots.
/*.png
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

# The waitlist form script is the one source of the sign-up behavior: revalidate so a fix is picked up promptly.
/*.js
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate

# HTML must revalidate so a redeploy of the landing copy is picked up promptly.
/*.html
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
